adjust.manualSql:
Changing the bucket count requires rebuilding the table, which is a complex operation. Run the following SQL manually:
-- 1. Create a new table (bucket count: {{buckets}})
-- 2. Migrate data: INSERT INTO new_table SELECT * FROM {{table}}
-- 3. Rename tables: ALTER TABLE {{table}} RENAME old_table; ALTER TABLE new_table RENAME {{table}}
-- 4. Drop the old table: DROP TABLE old_table
